{"id":"n64478-1-11","stage":4,"title":"솟아나다 · 奔涌","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64478-1-11-1","ko":"여기에서 물이 솟아나고 있어요.","zh":"这里有泉水涌出来哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기에서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기에서","audio":"/audio/6a94f02253a9c69fca8c.mp3"}},{"text":"물이","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물이","audio":"/audio/bbb693e9d07d2f260739.mp3"}},{"text":"솟아나고","meaning":"奔涌，喷涌，冒出","explanation":"솟아나다：奔涌，喷涌，冒出；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"솟아나다","audio":"/audio/cf1f25ed8359c2a9242b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64478","senseId":"1","lemma":"솟아나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"솟아나고","audio":"/audio/2359332079ad2bede384.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"cf1f25ed8359c2a9","term":"솟아나다","zh":"奔涌，喷涌，冒出","audio":"/audio/cf1f25ed8359c2a9242b.mp3","entryId":"64478","definition":"由内而外出来。","pronunciation":["소사나다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/65ca19a34de41abeafb4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64478-1-11-2","ko":"그럼 여기에 우물을 만드는 건 어떨까요?","zh":"那我们在这里挖口井怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기에","audio":"/audio/89d8715c5ec0d5fb9df5.mp3"}},{"text":"우물을","meaning":"井，水井","explanation":"우물：井，水井；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"우물","audio":"/audio/0bdb1a1b7587449fcd50.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70763","senseId":"1","lemma":"우물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우물을","audio":"/audio/1c25309747f4c5501647.mp3"}},{"text":"만드는","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만드는","audio":"/audio/5ace588de32e5a309a75.mp3"}},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건","audio":"/audio/f5fd44f22ad30ad631dc.mp3"}},{"text":"어떨까요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떨까요","audio":"/audio/149b2d431f7e627ded82.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"0bdb1a1b7587449f","term":"우물","zh":"井，水井","audio":"/audio/0bdb1a1b7587449fcd50.mp3","entryId":"70763","definition":"为了打水而挖地，使地下水聚集到一处的地方。","pronunciation":["우물"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/7dd926a0a5d3ecad1560.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.593,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64478","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4197,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这里有泉水涌出来哦。","那我们在这里挖口井怎么样？","最近您住在哪儿呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这里有泉水涌出来哦。","那我们在这里挖口井怎么样？","最近您住在哪儿呢？"],"answer":1}]}
